          "template": "| Vanuatu, {value} | Six province units at ADM1; OCHA/Pacific Community ADM2 area-council data (66 units in the inherited metadata) is finer neighboring granularity. | Retained 2017 OSM/Wambacher-derived layer is recorded under ODbL 1.0. Government profiles corroborate names and island groupings but not exact polygons. The cited OCHA layer metadata declares no license; no official exact province boundary source was established. |",
